  ✔ Diego will give a quest to do all 4 jobs: woodcutting, fishing, mining, crafting @done(24-06-09 05:33)
    - TALKED_WITH_DIEGO
  ☐ Jobs are marked on the map
  - After completing all jobs, Diego will give a quest to hunt infected boar
  - After completing the boar quest, Diego will give you a recipe for weapon upgrade and a task to hunt 5 more boars
  - After completing the boar task, Diego will give you a quest to talk with a captain at the docks
  - The captain will sail you to the main island for free. Usually it costs €1000.

